WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.131
Almost all losses of private individuals are not hacks but social engineering:

2
00:00:05.131 --> 00:00:09.484
the person hands over the phrase, a signature or a transfer themselves.

3
00:00:09.484 --> 00:00:11.077
Support that writes first.

4
00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:12.794
A lookalike site from an ad.

5
00:00:12.794 --> 00:00:16.962
A new acquaintance with their own platform you cannot withdraw from.

6
00:00:16.962 --> 00:00:19.598
Guaranteed income that is really a pyramid.

7
00:00:20.598 --> 00:00:21.621
The main points.

8
00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:25.263
Coins live in the blockchain, and a wallet holds the key:

9
00:00:25.263 --> 00:00:28.395
whoever knows the key or the phrase is the owner.

10
00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:32.741
On an exchange you trust the exchange; in your own wallet, yourself.

11
00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:37.278
And money is most often lost to a signature the person gave themselves.
